menuconfig THINKPAD_T470_MATRIX_DISCOVERY
    bool "ThinkPad T470 matrix discovery logging"
    default y if SHIELD_THINKPAD_T470
    depends on LOG
    help
      Logs each raw keyboard press and release as a DRV/SENSE coordinate and
      identifies the separate HOTKEY input. Intended for initial matrix mapping.
